|     Democrat    762 484                                                     |
|     Independent 327 239                                                     |
|     Republican  468 477                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : RObject of type list                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : chisqTest M                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 =                                                                         |
|             Pearson's Chi-squared test                                      |
|                                                                             |
|     data:  structure(list(F = c(762L, 327L, 468L), M = c(484L, 239L, 477L)),|
