  * Inputs:
      * s, a *note sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note R object: RObject,, a pairlist; 

Description
===========

Converts a Macaulay2 *note Sequence: (Macaulay2Doc)Sequence, to an R pairlist,
the linked-list type used internally by R for function argument lists.

+-----------------------------+
|i1 : RObject (2, 3, 5)       |
|                             |
|o1 = [[1]]                   |
|     [1] 2                   |
|                             |
|     [[2]]                   |
