|                             |
|     [[3]]                   |
|     [1] 5                   |
|                             |
|                             |
|o1 : RObject of type pairlist|
+-----------------------------+

When any elements are *note Option: (Macaulay2Doc)Option, objects, the keys
become names.

+---------------------------------+
|i2 : RObject (baz => 3, qux => 4)|
|                                 |
|o2 = $baz                        |
|     [1] 3                       |
|                                 |
|     $qux                        |
|     [1] 4                       |
|                                 |
|                                 |
|o2 : RObject of type pairlist    |
+---------------------------------+

