(Macaulay2Doc)SelfInitializingType,, with ancestor classes *note
FunctionClosure: (Macaulay2Doc)FunctionClosure, < *note Function:
(Macaulay2Doc)Function, < *note Thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

