library -- load an R package
****************************

  * Usage: 
        library pkg
  * Inputs:
      * pkg, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, 

Description
===========

This loads an R package.  It is an *note RFunction: RFunction, that calls R's
library function.

For example, suppose we want to load the abbey dataset with nickel content in a
Canadian syenite rock.  It is available in the MASS package.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : library "MASS"                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = [1] "MASS"      "stats"     "graphics"  "grDevices" "utils"             |
|     [7] "methods"   "base"                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : RObject of type character                                               |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|"datasets"                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : RSymbol "abbey"                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 =  [1]   5.2   6.5   6.9   7.0   7.0   7.0   7.4   8.0   8.0   8.0   8.0  |
|     [13]   9.0   9.0  10.0  11.0  11.0  12.0  12.0  13.7  14.0  14.0  14.0  |
|     [25]  17.0  17.0  18.0  24.0  28.0  34.0 125.0                          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : RObject of type double                                                  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| 8.5                                                                         |
|16.0                                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

For the programmer
==================

The object *note library: library, is an instance of the type *note RFunction:
RFunction,.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

