      * s, a *note string: (Macaulay2Doc)String,, R code to evaluate; 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note R object: RObject,, result of evaluating s; 

Description
===========

Evaluates R code in the R environment associated with the context. Variable
assignments persist across calls.

+----------------------------+
